      "body": "This will be possible if #1334 is merged. But fow now you can use this:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst sendText = (entity: DirectThreadEntity, test: string) => (entity as any).broadcast({\r\n  item: 'text',\r\n  form: {\r\n    text,\r\n  },\r\n});\r\n```\r\n_You can leave out the `as any` if you're not using Typescript._",
